## Agent testing targets (when cards exist)

### Simulation targets

- Average turn length (cards played per turn)
- Loop frequency at different draw card densities
- Which specific card combinations create infinite turns (loop-risk)
- Footprint pool sizing (does 15 feel restrictive or too generous?)
- XP curve: can a hero reach level 3 in a 3-wave scenario?
- Combo formula: average Sap output per tier vs. enemy Zeal pools
- Totem acquisition rate: can the group realistically fill 5 slots by scenario end?
- Prism Idol (loop-risk:true): does ×3 multiplier trivialize late waves?
- Trickle XP: does it slow DPS heroes appropriately?
- Emboldened pressure: enough without being unfair?
- Corrupted: counters poison without shutting down poison builds?

